      "timestamp": "0:00",
      "range": "0:00 - 0:00",
      "text": "On here."
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start": 1.2,
      "end": 2.72,
      "timestamp": "0:01",
      "range": "0:01 - 0:02",
      "text": "We had to act, had- Sorry."
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start": 2.8,
      "end": 4.56,
      "timestamp": "0:02",
      "range": "0:02 - 0:04",
      "text": "Uh- Start over."
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start": 4.68,
      "end": 4.92,
      "timestamp": "0:04",
      "range": "0:04 - 0:04",
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start": 6.2,
      "end": 6.48,
      "timestamp": "0:06",
      "range": "0:06 - 0:06",
      "text": "All right."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start": 6.78,
      "end": 6.94,
      "timestamp": "0:06",
      "range": "0:06 - 0:06",
      "text": "So,"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start": 9.58,
      "end": 12.02,
      "timestamp": "0:09",
      "range": "0:09 - 0:12",
      "text": "so we're getting close to being done."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start": 12.62,
      "end": 14.56,
      "timestamp": "0:12",
      "range": "0:12 - 0:14",
      "text": "I think we'll be done in two or three days."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start": 15.22,
      "end": 15.66,
      "timestamp": "0:15",
      "range": "0:15 - 0:15",
      "text": "And so"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start": 18.04,
      "end": 22.02,
      "timestamp": "0:18",
      "range": "0:18 - 0:22",
      "text": "the stone that we're putting on is amazing, and it looks beautiful."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start": 22.08,
      "end": 23.86,
      "timestamp": "0:22",
      "range": "0:22 - 0:23",
      "text": "Once we grout it, it's gonna look amazing."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start": 23.9,
      "end": 25.44,
      "timestamp": "0:23",
      "range": "0:23 - 0:25",
      "text": "Can you see how cool that stone is?"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start": 26.32,
      "end": 29.58,
      "timestamp": "0:26",
      "range": "0:26 - 0:29",
      "text": "Do you see those horizontal boards that we embedded in there?"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start": 30.26,
      "end": 32.3,
      "timestamp": "0:30",
      "range": "0:30 - 0:32",
      "text": "That's for us to mount the fireplace..."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start": 32.76,
      "end": 33.16,
      "timestamp": "0:32",
      "range": "0:32 - 0:33",
      "text": "Or sorry,"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start": 33.94,
      "end": 37.62,
      "timestamp": "0:33",
      "range": "0:33 - 0:37",
      "text": "the TV mounting bracket, because the TV's gonna go right there."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start": 38.44,
      "end": 42.06,
      "timestamp": "0:38",
      "range": "0:38 - 0:42",
      "text": "And, um, we had to install the cabinets beforehand"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start": 43.24,
      "end": 46.52,
      "timestamp": "0:43",
      "range": "0:43 - 0:46",
      "text": "so that-- because there's no way we were gonna install the cabinets around the stone."
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start": 46.58,
      "end": 51.56,
      "timestamp": "0:46",
      "range": "0:46 - 0:51",
      "text": "So we installed the cabinets beforehand, and these floating shelves, so that the stone guys"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start": 51.6,
      "end": 52.36,
      "timestamp": "0:51",
      "range": "0:51 - 0:52",
      "text": "can work around it."
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start": 52.42,
      "end": 55.38,
      "timestamp": "0:52",
      "range": "0:52 - 0:55",
      "text": "It's a lot easier for them to work around it than the shelving."
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start": 55.92,
      "end": 59.28,
      "timestamp": "0:55",
      "range": "0:55 - 0:59",
      "text": "And then if you kind of look down here underneath the scaffolding, you can kind of see the"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "start": 59.36,
      "end": 60.04,
      "timestamp": "0:59",
      "range": "0:59 - 1:00",
      "text": "fireplace."
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "start": 60.76,
      "end": 66.42,
      "timestamp": "1:00",
      "range": "1:00 - 1:06",
      "text": "We have our signature electric fireplace that we have used so many times on our entertainment"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "start": 66.48,
      "end": 66.88,
      "timestamp": "1:06",
      "range": "1:06 - 1:06",
      "text": "centers."
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "start": 67.32,
      "end": 73.38,
      "timestamp": "1:07",
      "range": "1:07 - 1:13",
      "text": "And, and that's available at Amazon, and we'll put a link to that fireplace in this video so"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "start": 73.42,
      "end": 75.04,
      "timestamp": "1:13",
      "range": "1:13 - 1:15",
      "text": "that you can go look at it."
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "start": 75.08,
      "end": 76.28,
      "timestamp": "1:15",
      "range": "1:15 - 1:16",
      "text": "It comes in different widths."
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "start": 77.22,
      "end": 81.4,
      "timestamp": "1:17",
      "range": "1:17 - 1:21",
      "text": "Um, so this one's like a fifty inch, but they-- you can get them up to seventy-two inches wide."
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "start": 81.86,
      "end": 86.52,
      "timestamp": "1:21",
      "range": "1:21 - 1:26",
      "text": "So they're really cool fireplaces that are electric, and you can do all kinds of colors, and"
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "start": 86.54,
      "end": 86.76,
      "timestamp": "1:26",
      "range": "1:26 - 1:26",
      "text": "they're..."
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "start": 86.84,
      "end": 87.56,
      "timestamp": "1:26",
      "range": "1:26 - 1:27",
      "text": "It's amazing."
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "start": 87.88,
      "end": 89.14,
      "timestamp": "1:27",
      "range": "1:27 - 1:29",
      "text": "You should, you should check it out."
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "start": 89.72,
      "end": 89.94,
      "timestamp": "1:29",
      "range": "1:29 - 1:29",
      "text": "Um,"
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "start": 91.46,
      "end": 92.84,
      "timestamp": "1:31",
      "range": "1:31 - 1:32",
      "text": "so my stone guys are coming today."
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "start": 92.88,
      "end": 94.52,
      "timestamp": "1:32",
      "range": "1:32 - 1:34",
      "text": "They're gonna finish the stone today."
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "start": 95.16,
      "end": 97.66,
      "timestamp": "1:35",
      "range": "1:35 - 1:37",
      "text": "Today's Saturday, and then they're gonna grout on Monday."
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "start": 98.16,
      "end": 101.2,
      "timestamp": "1:38",
      "range": "1:38 - 1:41",
      "text": "And then we'll be ready to kind of clean up and put everything back together."
    }
